00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.033
Bewoop.

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:19.740
- My name is Nathaniel, I'm 27 years old

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.583
and I'm in a serious
relationship with my car.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:27.490
- Interesting.

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:28.663
- [Nathaniel] Morning, baby.

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:31.210
