00:00:40.559 --> 00:00:43.680
(suspenseful music)

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.720
- You know, this objectophilia
seems like it runs

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:49.090
in a similar pattern as animism,
where someone believes that

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:53.140
a inanimate object has a
spirit that is living on

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:54.580
and that's why they fall in love with it.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:56.580
- [Narrator] Nathaniel's
relationship with Chase

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.740
