00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:01.753
- We have our times when we get sexual.

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:04.010
Does that feel good?

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:07.030
- There has been some
research that has showed

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:09.730
a sexual gratification or objectification

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.350
