00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:15.660
in a similar course also with autism,

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.360
so I don't know if autism
was in fact diagnosed

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:19.193
in this case.

00:01:19.193 --> 00:01:20.150
- I'm 19 years old

00:01:21.421 --> 00:01:23.021
