00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:12.823
- I'm 20 years old and I'm
addicted to drinking gasoline.

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:16.900
- Gasoline is toxic,

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:19.640
and I'm not just saying
drinking it, inhaling it,

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:20.890
