washroom and drink the gas.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.100
- This is super dangerous
because of a compound called

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:46.150
hydrocarbons found within gasoline,

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:49.280
which actually act as essential
nervous system depressant.

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:51.900
You can almost feel like
you're drunk off of it,

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:55.110
but the danger that it
causes to your GI tract,

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:58.150
your vital organs, outweigh
any potential benefit

00:02:58.150 --> 00:02:58.983
of consuming it.

00:02:58.983 --> 00:03:01.600
- [Narrator] Stanley
might be 31 years old,

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:03.610
