medicine and healthcare

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.510
whether or not something is a disorder

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:24.380
is based on the patient's own life.

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:26.740
If the patient is not having an issue

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:30.700
maintaining a job, maintaining
healthy social connections,

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.300
maintaining a relationship,

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:36.420
if all these major developmental
aspects of life are normal,

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:37.253
this is not a disorder.

00:03:37.253 --> 00:03:39.410
We have to be very careful
with our definitions here.

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:42.210
